    "module": {
      "summary": "Family allowance example RuleSpec module.\n\nHousehold receives a flat per-child monthly allowance provided total\nearned income does not exceed a size-keyed limit. Size-keyed tables\naren't a parameter primitive in the deployed DSL, so we encode them as\n`match household_size` statements. The caller supplies each member's\n`earned_income` input; the household-size count comes from the\n`member_of_household` relation.\n\nSynthetic RuleSpec module — not modelled on any specific statute."
